{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120083443082-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120095436\"/><p>私家車意外後翻側。</p><p>大埔發生交通意外。今晨(20日)8時34分，一輛私家車沿吐露港公路往上水方向行駛，至近康樂園對開時，失控撞向路旁石壆後向左翻側，橫亘行車線上，司機自行報案求助。救援人員接報到場前，司機已自行爬出車外。受事件影響往上水方向交通一度受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:03:55.974560+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:34:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:13.031893+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:30.216483+00:00","content_hash":"21daccb10ec3374c093e657ce58533b08d562289f0f3a3218ca05e563c66ba90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:03:55.974560+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}